== Trivia ==
* The phrase "Itchy, tasty..." is a reference to the Keeper's Diary from ''Resident Evil''. The Diary describes the slow transformation of a researcher into a zombie as his entries become less and less coherent due to neural decay caused by t-Virus infection. His final entry consists of two words: "Itchy. Tasty.".

